net rapidchange-dust-cover      motion.digital-out-00   => hm2_[MESA](BOARD).0.ssr.00.out-05
net rapidchange-ir              motion.digital-in-00    <= hm2_[MESA](BOARD).0.inmux.00.input-15
net rapidchange-toolsetter      hm2_[MESA](BOARD).0.inmux.00.input-14-not

# If no other probes
#   net rapidchange-toolsetter motion.probe-input
# If other probes
#   loadrt or2 names=probes
#   addf or2 servo-thread
#   net rapidchange-toolsetter  or2.in0
#   net other-probe             or2.in1
#   net any-probe               or2.out => motion.probe-input


# Loopback default tool change iocontrol
net tool-prepare-loopback iocontrol.0.tool-prepare => iocontrol.0.tool-prepared
net tool-change-loopback iocontrol.0.tool-change => iocontrol.0.tool-changed
